    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in a quiet and highly sought-after location within the ever-popular Ridgewood development, 51 Cedar Grove is an exceptionally well-presented four-bedroom, three-bathroom end-of-terrace family home extending to approximately 151sq.m. (1,625sq.ft.). Arranged over three spacious floors, this modern residence offers generous living accommodation, excellent storage, and a superb layout that will appeal to growing families seeking both comfort and convenience.\nFrom the moment you arrive, the property impresses with its attractive façade and large cobblelock driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. Internally, a welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious reception room featuring a stylish fireplace, built-in storage and direct access to the rear garden. To the front of the property, the well-appointed kitchen/dining room provides an excellent family space with a range of fitted units, integrated appliances and ample dining space. A guest WC and additional storage complete the ground floor accommodation.\nThe first floor hosts three generous double bedrooms together with a Jack-and-Jill family bathroom. The impressive top floor has been dedicated entirely to the luxurious principal bedroom suite, complete with a large walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite bathroom, creating a peaceful retreat away from the rest of the home.\nOutside, the private rear garden is fully paved for ease of maintenance and enjoys a high degree of privacy. A large garden shed provides excellent additional storage space.\nIdeally situated in the heart of Ridgewood, the property enjoys close proximity to an abundance of local amenities including shops, schools, parks, sports clubs and regular public transport services. Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways, Airside Retail Park, Pavilions Shopping Centre and Swords Village are all easily accessible, making this a highly convenient location for modern family living.\nThis outstanding family home combines spacious accommodation, excellent presentation and a prime location, making it a property that must be viewed to be fully appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 2.1m\nBright and welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring, radiator and frosted double-glazed window to the front aspect.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.2m x 3.3m\nA spacious and well-equipped family kitchen featuring an extensive range of fitted wall and floor units, stainless steel sink with mixer tap, built-in oven and electric hob with extractor hood, integrated dishwasher and washing machine. Finished with tiled flooring, part-tiled walls and double-glazed windows overlooking the front.\n\nLiving - 5.5m x 5.3m\nA large and light-filled reception room with wood flooring, feature fireplace with electric fire, built-in storage, two radiators and double-glazed doors opening onto the rear garden.\n\nw.c - 2.0m x 1.6m\nComprising tiled flooring, WC, wash hand basin, wall-mounted mirror, storage cupboard, extractor fan and frosted double-glazed side window.\n\nLanding - 5.5m x 2.0m\nWood flooring, hot press and staircase access to the second floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 3.5m\nSpacious double bedroom featuring an excellent range of built-in wardrobes, wood flooring and attractive bay window to the front.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.1m x 2.6m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring, built-in wardrobe and double-glazed window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.2m x 2.6m\nDouble bedroom with wood flooring and double-glazed rear window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 3.0m\nImpressive main bedroom occupying the entire top floor, featuring wood flooring, excellent natural light and direct access to the walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\n\nBathroom - 2.9m x 1.2m\nModern ensuite bathroom comprising walk-in shower, WC, wash hand basin, mirrored cabinet, tiled flooring, partially tiled walls and extractor fan.\n\nWalk-in-wardrobe - 1.4m x 5.3m\nGenerous dressing area complete with bespoke hanging space and fitted storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Four-bedroom end-of-terrace family home</li><li> Excellent decorative condition throughout</li><li> Spacious accommodation extending to approx. 143 sq.m. / 1,539 sq.ft.</li><li> Large principal bedroom suite with ensuite</li><li> Generous walk-in wardrobe</li><li> Three further double bedrooms</li><li> Guest WC on ground floor</li><li> Private low-maintenance rear garden</li><li> Driveway parking for two cars</li><li> Quiet residential setting within Ridgewood</ul>"
      },
